You are implementing a Blazor Web App shipment tracker for a logistics company. The project is already scaffolded at:

- Server project: `/tmp/sv-e4e229dc45ed4434a8dcb94539c8e3b4/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/`
- Client project: `/tmp/sv-e4e229dc45ed4434a8dcb94539c8e3b4/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/`

The project uses:
- .NET 9 (global.json pins to 9.0.315)
- Interactive Auto mode, Global interactivity
- ASP.NET Core Identity with Individual accounts (SQLite)

## Architecture Rules (Auto Global mode)
- All interactive components MUST go in the `.Client` project
- Components cannot access DbContext directly — must use HTTP APIs
- Define service interfaces in `.Client`, implement with HttpClient in `.Client` and with direct DB access in the server
- Register matching services in both `Program.cs` files
- Pages don't need `@rendermode` — global mode handles it

## What to implement

### 1. Shared Model (in `.Client` project, since both sides need it)

Create `/tmp/sv-e4e229dc45ed4434a8dcb94539c8e3b4/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Models/Shipment.cs`:

```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public class Shipment
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public ShipmentStatus Status { get; set; }
    public DateTime ShippedDate { get; set; }
    public DateTime EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public string CustomerEmail { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string? Notes { get; set; }
}

public enum ShipmentStatus
{
    Pending,
    PickedUp,
    InTransit,
    OutForDelivery,
    Delivered,
    Exception
}
```

### 2. Service Interface (in `.Client` project)

Create `/tmp/sv-e4e229dc45ed4434a8dcb94539c8e3b4/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/IShipmentService.cs`:

```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public interface IShipmentService
{
    Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync();
    Task<Shipment?> GetByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber);
    Task UpdateStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus status);
}
```

### 3. Client-side implementation (HttpClient-based)

Create `/tmp/sv-e4e229dc45ed4434a8dcb94539c8e3b4/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/ClientShipmentService.cs`:

```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

using System.Net.Http.Json;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public class ClientShipmentService(HttpClient http) : IShipmentService
{
    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        return await http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<Shipment>>("api/shipments") ?? [];
    }

    public async Task<Shipment?> GetByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        return await http.GetFromJsonAsync<Shipment?>($"api/shipments/track/{trackingNumber}");
    }

    public async Task UpdateStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus status)
    {
        await http.PutAsJsonAsync($"api/shipments/{id}/status", status);
    }
}
```

### 4. Server-side Entity and DbContext extension

Create `/tmp/sv-e4e229dc45ed4434a8dcb94539c8e3b4/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Data/ShipmentEntity.cs`:

```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Data;

using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public class ShipmentEntity
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public ShipmentStatus Status { get; set; }
    public DateTime ShippedDate { get; set; }
    public DateTime EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public string CustomerEmail { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string? Notes { get; set; }

    public Shipment ToModel() => new()
    {
        Id = Id,
        TrackingNumber = TrackingNumber,
        Origin = Origin,
        Destination = Destination,
        Status = Status,
        ShippedDate = ShippedDate,
        EstimatedDelivery = EstimatedDelivery,
        CustomerEmail = CustomerEmail,
        Notes = Notes
    };
}
```

Modify the existing `ApplicationDbContext` at `/tmp/sv-e4e229dc45ed4434a8dcb94539c8e3b4/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Data/ApplicationDbContext.cs` to add a `DbSet<ShipmentEntity>`:

Add this line inside the class:
```csharp
public DbSet<ShipmentEntity> Shipments => Set<ShipmentEntity>();
```

### 5. Server-side service implementation

Create `/tmp/sv-e4e229dc45ed4434a8dcb94539c8e3b4/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Services/ServerShipmentService.cs`:

```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Services;

using Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;
using ShipmentTracker.Data;

public class ServerShipmentService(ApplicationDbContext db) : IShipmentService
{
    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        return await db.Shipments
            .OrderByDescending(s => s.ShippedDate)
            .Select(s => s.ToModel())
            .ToListAsync();
    }

    public async Task<Shipment?> GetByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        var entity = await db.Shipments
            .FirstOrDefaultAsync(s => s.TrackingNumber == trackingNumber);
        return entity?.ToModel();
    }

    public async Task UpdateStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus status)
    {
        var entity = await db.Shipments.FindAsync(id);
        if (entity is not null)
        {
            entity.Status = status;
            await db.SaveChangesAsync();
        }
    }
}
```

### 6. API Endpoints

Create `/tmp/sv-e4e229dc45ed4434a8dcb94539c8e3b4/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Endpoints/ShipmentEndpoints.cs`:

```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Endpoints;

using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public static class ShipmentEndpoints
{
    public static void MapShipmentEndpoints(this WebApplication app)
    {
        var group = app.MapGroup("api/shipments").RequireAuthorization();

        group.MapGet("", async (IShipmentService service) =>
            await service.GetAllShipmentsAsync());

        group.MapGet("track/{trackingNumber}", async (string trackingNumber, IShipmentService service) =>
        {
            var shipment = await service.GetByTrackingNumberAsync(trackingNumber);
            return shipment is not null ? Results.Ok(shipment) : Results.NotFound();
        });

        group.MapPut("{id}/status", async (int id, ShipmentStatus status, IShipmentService service) =>
        {
            await service.UpdateStatusAsync(id, status);
            return Results.NoContent();
        });
    }
}
```

### 7. Seed data

Create `/tmp/sv-e4e229dc45ed4434a8dcb94539c8e3b4/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Data/SeedData.cs`:

```csharp
